## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0670, std = 0.1380, ICIR = 0.49, HAC t-stat = 7.9 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0811, std = 0.1331, IR = 0.61, HAC t-stat = 10.0 (lags=5)
